<title>UK: Telkom at $29.55 in London at 0831 GMT.</title>
<headline>Telkom at $29.55 in London at 0831 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telkom traded at $29.55 and London at 0831 GMT on Tuesday. It recorded the day's low of $29.55 and the day's high of $29.625.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Monday $29.075. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
